+        "Accessibility Keyboard Hotkeys",
+        nullptr,
+        "Lets the reader see keyboard letters (R stop, U repeat, I/O/J/K/L/P/C/E/N/B navigation) "
+        "through the frontend's keyboard device.\n"
+        "\n"
+        "Leave Game Focus OFF. Game Focus blocks RetroArch's keyboard-to-RetroPad mapping, which would take "
+        "away the arrow keys and the letters bound to DS buttons; the reader's letters arrive perfectly well "
